<title>USA: Tubby's signs Detroit development pact.</title>
<headline>Tubby's signs Detroit development pact.</headline>
<dateline>STERLING HEIGHTS, Mich. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tubby's Inc said Monday Dennis Archer Jr and Ken Watson signed an agreement to develop 20 Tubby's Submarines stores in the City of Detroit.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Tubby's president Robert Paganes said the agreement &quot;gives us more stability in a market which already exists, and some of our highest grossing stores are already in that market.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
